*** <code>int OptionsPickupIndex</code>: Any non-zero value causes the item to form an option group with any other item with the same <code>OptionsPickupIndex</code> value. When an item belonging to an option group is picked up, all other items belonging to the same group disappear. 0 is the default value and means the item doesn't belong to any group.
